   Fork Notice
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   This repository is a fork of the official `kotlinx-io` library, created to
   prototype interoperability between Kotlin/Native and the Swift build system
   (`swift-build`) and to provide Swift Package Manager (SPM) compatibility.

   Modifications in this fork include:
   - Addition of an SPM `Package.swift` manifest
   - Addition of SPM-compatible `.kt.swift` source shims
   - Embedding Kotlin/Native (`konanc`) configuration via `cSettings`
   - Mapping of the Okio dependency to a SwiftPM-compatible fork
   - Build metadata enabling integration with a custom `swift-build` toolchain

